**False.**

The colour code of a domestic supply is:

- **Red** insulation — the **live** wire;
- **Black** insulation — the **neutral** wire;
- **Green** insulation — the **earth** wire.

So a green wire is the earth wire, not the live wire. It is connected to a metal plate buried deep in the earth and is a safety conductor, carrying leakage current away from the metallic body of an appliance.
